  "remarks": "\nAl-Solag Mining Company Ltd is an involved person under The Sudan (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2020 as it is associated with a person, Meroe Gold (part of the Wagner Group of Companies) which is involved in a policy or activity which threatens the peace, stability and security of Sudan. \n",
